+# TB-FIN-01C / TB-08-R2-R5-R5-R2-R1 — offline installed approval desktop
+
+Status: scoped positive installed graphical approval and two consecutive authenticated PAPER recovery cycles PASS. The real in-window lock/seat-switch/logoff-before-confirmation negative matrix, and standalone cancellation before submission, remain open at the installed production-launcher level. Prior local session-loss checks and R5-R4 transient cancellation results do not substitute. No real trading, credentials, desk change, main merge, or CI dispatch.
